  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>Creatures that share your rapport can share their space with another creature within the rapport. If two such creatures are threatening the same creature, they are considered to be flanking the creature as if they were in two opposing squares.</p>\n<p>You are also considered to possess the swarming racial trait for the purposes of determining the prerequisites of feats.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat</strong>: Cooperative Swarmer (<em>Blood of the Beast</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
